| `keyvault` | Manage Key Vault secrets/keys/certificates |
| `redis` | Azure Managed Redis / Cache for Redis |
| `sql` | Azure SQL databases, servers, elastic pools |
| `storage` | Storage accounts, blob containers, tables |
| `eventhubs` | Event Hubs namespaces |
| `servicebus` | Service Bus queues, topics, subscriptions |

